	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11109"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=753" title="View the profile of Spaerhawk">Spaerhawk</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 12<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://img14.imageshack.us/img14/9018/JohnCusack.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=753"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1113.msg11109#msg11109"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1113.msg11109#msg11109">Re: I have no money.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #17 on:</b> September 13, 2004, 11:12:23 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Ok... So, to compile a list of what I could do:<br /><br />Get a second job.<br />Sell my EQ account.<br />Become a woman and flash some cleavage.<br />Find a Sugar Mama.<br />Stand on the street with a sign.<br />Make more money.<br />Spend less.<br />Become a man-servant.<br /><br />I don&#039;t particularly like any of those options. *Especially* anything that requires me to do more work.<br /><br />Any other ideas?
						</td>
					</tr>
