							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Any other ideas?</div><br />Sell your junk on <img src="http://pics.ebaystatic.com/aw/pics/navbar/redesign_p1/ebayLogo.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />You do need a way to take pictures of your items.&nbsp; You can post them free here: <a href="http://www.imageshack.us/index.php" target="_blank">http://www.imageshack.us/index.php</a>.<br /><br />You would need to set up a pay pal account.<br /><br />People seriously make a decent living doing this.&nbsp; After they run out of their own junk, they buy stuff at garage sales, discount stores, second hand stores...and resell to the ebay buyers.<br /><br />If I didn&#039;t have kids to feed and insure, I&#039;d try it!
						</td>
