							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Suggested many years ago by an old high school teacher of mine...<br /><br />Walk into one of those restaurants that lets you throw peanut shells on the floor.&nbsp; They&#039;re allowing a possibly hazardous condition, so they&#039;re liable if something bad happens.&nbsp; Take a prat fall.&nbsp; Fake a back injury.&nbsp; They can be very hard to properly diagnose.&nbsp; You just claim it hurts a lot and stuff.&nbsp; Sue.&nbsp; Be the nice guy and settle for 50 grand.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/approve.gif" alt="approve" border="0" />
